        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Poses as H3 references\n\nThe portrait is the character. The costume and the first two poses are reference images 1 to 3 of the H3 Character Sheet Designer. The designer writes the prompt and the sheet size; its pictures go to H3 Image Conditioning in the order character, layout, references.\n\nPose Picker outputs `pose_1` and `pose_2` only. Pick two poses, or leave a slot empty to get a blank white image."
      ]
